{%- comment -%}
  Price cluster — the amount, and nothing else.

  It used to print a per-dose figure beneath the price ("≈ ₹24/day"). That was
  removed on request: the arithmetic invites a comparison with the cheapest
  tablet on the shelf, which is the ground this brand does not want to fight on.
  The unit parameters are gone with it; do not reintroduce them here without
  deciding that argument first.

  Parameters
    price  required  Shopify price in the shop's minor unit (paise).

  Usage
    {% render 'gc-price', price: product.price %}
{%- endcomment -%}
<span class="gc-price">
  <span class="gc-price__now">{% render 'gc-money', price: price %}</span>
</span>
